# Every list the program consumes is rebuilt in its own cells: reverse
# turns each cell it visits around in place, and every take in body is of
# a cell it never gives a second reference; and no walk counts a
# reference: the input is read into cells without a dup or a drop, and
# reverse neither counts nor tests one. Each line is written as its list
# is walked: no string is built only to be written.
owned: reuses-in-place=@Prelude.Types.List.reverseOnto counts-nothing=@Prelude.Types.List.reverseOnto tests-nothing=@Prelude.Types.List.reverseOnto counts-nothing=@Main.readAll resets-unshared=@Main.body output-fused
